1
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:28,451
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,163
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,632
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,686
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:43,093
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:46,725
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,691
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:55,331
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,971
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,019
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,019 --> 00:01:07,971
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,163 --> 00:01:11,851
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,422
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,587 --> 00:01:22,531
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,979 --> 00:01:26,600
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,284
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,371 --> 00:01:35,299
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:39,459
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,203 --> 00:01:46,755
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,424 --> 00:01:49,955
=Episode 4=

21
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:54,560
Mr. Rong, you tried to frame me today.
What an act.

22
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:59,920
I thought you're only an actor,
but it turns out you're a schemer.

23
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,519
Young Marshal, you flatter me.

24
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,640
I am naturally no match for you.

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,719
Otherwise, you would
have been a prisoner by now.

26
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:17,120
How dare you play tricks here?
Be careful, you might get burned.

27
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,479
Don't worry.

28
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:27,159
An actor's tricks
are confined to the small stage.

29
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:33,240
Just you? Think you can
use the Xiaosheng Society to kill me?

30
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:39,039
Do you believe I'll kill you?

31
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,240
If you truly wanted to kill me,

32
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:48,520
you wouldn't have only cut my clothes.

33
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:54,889
Do you really think
the Buddha Head's whereabouts

34
00:02:54,889 --> 00:02:56,919
can save your life?

35
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,639
What if it can't?

36
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:04,520
How do you know
whether I want to live or die?

37
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:09,120
After all, the play has just begun.

38
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:18,759
If I scar this face,
how will you continue the play?

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:22,560
It's just a show.
What are you afraid of, Young Marshal?

40
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:26,639
You also performed well today.

41
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:30,319
It was clearly a dead end,
yet you managed to live.

42
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:37,039
But I will never
let you finish this play alive.

43
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:44,719
As expected, actors have no loyalty.

44
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:50,960
I spared your life over and over again,
but you keep pushing your luck.

45
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,479
Loyalty?

46
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,479
You killed my master.

47
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,759
You Governor Mansion
massacred the Rongqing Troupe.

48
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:03,400
If I could, I would have
killed everyone here already.

49
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,560
I have never met your master.

50
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:08,280
What makes you so sure
that I killed him?

51
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:10,919
I saw it. It was with that saber.

52
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,759
You framed me for killing Master.

53
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,360
I will never forgive you
and fight you to the end.

54
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:23,079
If you truly saw it, you should know
that I did not kill Head Rong.

55
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:27,040
You've got the wrong target.

56
00:04:27,616 --> 00:04:31,519
Even now, you're still denying it.

57
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:37,959
By now, you should also understand

58
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:43,360
that on your own, you can't do
any harm to the Governor.

59
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:51,360
If you truly want to avenge your master,
then help me find the Buddha Head.

60
00:04:51,936 --> 00:04:55,879
Think I would believe you
with just a few words from you?

61
00:04:56,192 --> 00:04:57,120
Dream on.

62
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:59,160
Believe it or not,

63
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:03,120
only I can save you,
and only I can help you.

64
00:05:10,944 --> 00:05:14,304
(Chang'an)

65
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:32,519
(Mother, don't worry.)

66
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,079
(Shitou is fine.)

67
00:05:56,768 --> 00:05:58,319
When the Rongqing Troupe was arrested,

68
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,744
(Yue Niang, Cleaner of Rongqing Troupe)
she happened to be out buying supplies,

69
00:05:59,744 --> 00:06:01,040
so she escaped.

70
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:03,168
After learning of the troupe's incident,

71
00:06:03,168 --> 00:06:04,439
she has been hiding.

72
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:07,839
After extensive investigation,
I finally caught her.

73
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,240
I really didn't do anything.

74
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,040
Please spare my life!

75
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,759
Please spare my life!

76
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,360
She truly knows nothing
about the Buddha Head.

77
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:25,499
But Young Marshal seems
to have inextricable ties

78
00:06:25,856 --> 00:06:27,759
to the theft of the Buddha Head.

79
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:17,519
You seem to prefer to visit
the Governor Mansion late at night.

80
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:21,160
Sorry to disturb you.

81
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:25,480
The wedding is approaching,
yet the wedding attire hasn't been made.

82
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:29,560
So I thought to take one of your suits
to measure your size.

83
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:35,120
Since you're here, why waste time?

84
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:42,160
Miss Jiang, please help me
measure my size.

85
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:46,040
It's better
to leave this to your tailor.

86
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:50,040
Earlier, you begged me
to spare Rong Xiaonan's life.

87
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:55,279
Now, you're unwilling
to help me with this small favor?

88
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:02,639
But don't forget,
his life is still in my hands.

89
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,920
Where is the measuring tape?

90
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,319
Use your hands.

91
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:50,879
Touching my skin makes you so nervous?

92
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:56,279
Miss Jiang, do you like me or fear me?

93
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:03,200
We are not yet married.
So we should keep our distance.

94
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,519
Since you know that...

95
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,639
Why are you still entangled
with that Rong Xiaonan?

96
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:26,519
Are you treating the Governor Mansion
as a theater troupe?

97
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,679
You're probably overthinking.

98
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,759
Our Jiang family has strict rules.

99
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:33,919
I have never had such improper behavior
with Mr. Rong as I have with you now.

100
00:09:35,456 --> 00:09:39,200
Touching me is improper?

101
00:09:40,879 --> 00:09:46,080
Then let me show you
what improper behavior is.

102
00:10:02,001 --> 00:10:04,993
♪A thousand sails gone♪

103
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:11,480
Miss Jiang, you risked your life
to help Rong Xiaonan escape.

104
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:19,320
You are truly brave and courageous.

105
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:23,961
♪Suddenly it's dusk♪

106
00:10:23,968 --> 00:10:25,472
Do you really think

107
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:29,152
that you can hide anything

108
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,320
from me in my house?

109
00:10:34,592 --> 00:10:37,790
♪The moon as before♪

110
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,639
Since you know everything,

111
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:44,440
then punish me as you please.

112
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,720
Miss Jiang, you are truly heartless.

113
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:52,480
Do you want me to kill my wife
before the wedding and have my name ruined?

114
00:10:54,624 --> 00:11:00,160
♪Trapped in dawn and dusk♪

115
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:02,083
♪Candle by the west window♪

116
00:11:02,083 --> 00:11:04,768
♪Burned out this life♪

117
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:10,279
Miss Jiang, please tell
the measurements to tailors.

118
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,639
Don't delay our wedding.

119
00:11:15,104 --> 00:11:16,736
♪A handful of earth♪

120
00:11:16,928 --> 00:11:19,499
♪The world's last gamble♪

121
00:11:19,584 --> 00:11:23,524
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

122
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:30,131
♪No one comes to meet me♪

123
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,480
Foster Father,

124
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,919
why call me so early in the morning?

125
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:53,679
Bring her up.

126
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,440
Rise and speak.

127
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,840
Take a good look. Is it him?

128
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,120
Young Marshal Xu is different
from other guests.

129
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:17,279
Even when the play started,
he went straight backstage.

130
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:21,120
He'd talk with Head Rong privately
in the room, shutting everyone out.

131
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,480
That's why I remember.

132
00:12:23,919 --> 00:12:29,600
Do you think you can slander me
with such false accusations?

133
00:12:29,759 --> 00:12:33,720
Besides, with your status,
how could you recognize me?

134
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,559
I...

135
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,639
I recognize your face.

136
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:41,120
Xu the Demon, the Young Marshal.
Everyone in Fengcheng knows you.

137
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:43,759
Evidence.

138
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:44,440
Yes.

139
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,519
I have evidence.

140
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,120
Governor,

141
00:12:51,039 --> 00:12:52,200
it is indeed his army emblem.

142
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,970
That day, I went backstage
to get something

143
00:12:55,970 --> 00:12:58,879
and saw you talking
with Head Rong in the room.

144
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,608
The door was ajar.

145
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:05,120
I overheard you talking
about the Buddha Head.

146
00:13:05,759 --> 00:13:06,919
I didn't dare linger.

147
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:11,000
But later, when I went to clean,
I found this under the table.

148
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,440
It was the day he first came
to the Rongqing Troupe.

149
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,399
Governor,

150
00:13:17,024 --> 00:13:19,328
not long after Young Marshal
went to the Rongqing Troupe,

151
00:13:19,328 --> 00:13:21,200
the Buddha Head murder case occurred.

152
00:13:21,519 --> 00:13:24,120
According to Yue Niang's testimony,

153
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:27,439
on the 16th of last month,
when the Buddha Head was stolen,

154
00:13:27,439 --> 00:13:30,120
Young Marshal also appeared
at the Rongqing Troupe.

155
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,039
Foster Father,

156
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,799
would you believe such absurd testimony?

157
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,879
My engagement to Miss Jiang
was arranged by you.

158
00:13:37,279 --> 00:13:40,799
I've never been to the Rongqing Troupe
to secretly meet Head Rong.

159
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,000
You traitor!

160
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,879
Still denying it?

161
00:14:01,519 --> 00:14:02,440
(Foster Father.)

162
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:10,320
(So it was you
who wanted to get rid of me.)

163
00:14:31,392 --> 00:14:32,672
♪As if it were fate♪

164
00:14:32,672 --> 00:14:34,112
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

165
00:14:34,591 --> 00:14:37,828
♪We miss each other♪

166
00:14:39,072 --> 00:14:40,640
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

167
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:43,040
♪And a bizarre♪

168
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:45,842
♪Anonymous legend♪

169
00:14:46,372 --> 00:14:48,384
♪The plot twists and turns♪

170
00:14:48,532 --> 00:14:50,272
♪Play out over and over again♪

171
00:14:50,272 --> 00:14:53,336
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

172
00:14:53,664 --> 00:14:55,616
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

173
00:14:55,616 --> 00:14:56,608
♪Refuse to submit♪

174
00:14:56,608 --> 00:14:59,808
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

175
00:15:01,472 --> 00:15:04,384
♪There are always too many♪

176
00:15:04,384 --> 00:15:06,272
♪Helpless situations♪

177
00:15:06,272 --> 00:15:08,896
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

178
00:15:10,027 --> 00:15:11,987
♪Even if I have questions♪

179
00:15:11,987 --> 00:15:13,987
♪I harbor desires♪

180
00:15:13,987 --> 00:15:16,864
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

181
00:15:17,215 --> 00:15:18,848
♪People come and go♪

182
00:15:18,848 --> 00:15:21,664
♪I'm still all alone♪

183
00:15:21,664 --> 00:15:24,392
♪Wandering around♪

184
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:27,493
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

185
00:15:27,493 --> 00:15:31,954
♪Go through the entanglement♪

186
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,048
♪If longing♪

187
00:15:34,048 --> 00:15:37,207
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

188
00:15:37,207 --> 00:15:39,962
♪How can I be at ease♪

189
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:42,378
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

190
00:15:42,496 --> 00:15:44,352
♪And travelled around the world♪

191
00:15:44,448 --> 00:15:47,536
♪Scars all over me♪

192
00:15:47,808 --> 00:15:50,720
♪If longing never fades♪

193
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,169
♪Burns still hot♪

194
00:15:52,169 --> 00:15:55,248
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

195
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,377
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

196
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,624
♪In the next life♪

197
00:15:58,624 --> 00:16:03,104
♪Entangle with you again♪
